<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f9f6">
  <title>拾光账本 · 让每笔收支都有温度</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="assets/logo.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
 <div class="app-shell">
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="brand"><img src="assets/logo.svg" alt="拾光标识"/><div><strong>拾光账本</strong><span>POCKET DAYS</span></div></div>
    <div class="nav-label">工作台</div>
    <nav aria-label="主导航">
      <button class="nav-item active" data-section="overview"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/></svg> 总览 <span class="nav-dot"></span></button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-section="records"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13"/><path d="m3 6 1 1 2-2M3 12h3M3 18h3"/></svg> 收支明细</button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-section="stats"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3v18h18M7 16v-4M12 16V7M17 16v-8"/></svg> 统计分析</button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-section="categories"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3h8l10 10-8 8L3 11V3Z"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="1.2"/></svg> 分类管理</button>
    </nav>
    <div class="side-spacer"></div>
    <div class="side-illustration"><div class="mini-star">✳</div><img src="assets/wallet.svg" alt="钱包与绿植装饰"/><strong>给生活一点「账」力</strong><p>记录不是限制，而是更自由地安排每一天。</p></div>
    <div class="side-footer"><span class="status-dot"></span> 本地私密存储 <span class="version">v1.0</span></div>
  </aside>
  <main class="main">
    <header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb">我的空间 <span>/</span> <strong id="crumb">收支总览</strong></div><div class="top-actions"><div class="date-chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M7 3v4m10-4v4M3 10h18"/></svg> 2026 年 11 月</div><div class="avatar" title="我的账本">拾</div></div></header>
    <div class="page-content">
      <div class="welcome"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="sun">✳</span> YOUR FINANCIAL CORNER <span class="dash"></span> 轻松记账</div><h1>把日子过好，<em>也把账记好。</em></h1><p>今天也来留下一点生活的痕迹吧。每一笔小小的记录，都在帮你靠近理想生活。</p></div><button class="primary-btn" id="open-add"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg> 记一笔 <span class="key-hint">＋</span></button></div>
      <div class="summary-grid" id="summary">
        <section class="summary-card total"><div class="summary-head"><span>本月结余</span><div class="summary-icon">↗</div></div><div class="summary-money"><small>¥</small>5,850<span>.00</span></div><div class="summary-foot"><span class="trend-pill">↑ 12.8%</span> 比上个月更从容</div><div class="total-decoration total-orb"></div><div class="total-decoration total-orb2"></div></section>
        <section class="summary-card income"><div class="summary-head"><span>本月收入</span><div class="summary-icon">↙</div></div><div class="summary-money"><small>¥</small>8,200<span>.00</span></div><div class="summary-foot"><span class="round-dot income-dot"></span> 共 4 笔收入</div><span class="card-art">✦</span></section>
        <section class="summary-card expense"><div class="summary-head"><span>本月支出</span><div class="summary-icon">↗</div></div><div class="summary-money"><small>¥</small>2,350<span>.00</span></div><div class="summary-foot"><span class="round-dot expense-dot"></span> 共 18 笔支出</div><span class="card-art">✳</span></section>
      </div>
      <div class="content-grid">
        <section class="panel flow-panel" id="trends"><div class="panel-top"><div><div class="section-kicker">CASH FLOW</div><h2>收支小趋势 <span class="soft-spark">✺</span></h2><p>看看钱都在什么时候悄悄来去</p></div><div class="toggle" aria-label="图表时段"><button class="selected" data-period="month">近 6 个月</button><button data-period="week">近 7 天</button></div></div><div class="legend"><span><i class="legend-inc"></i> 收入</span><span><i class="legend-exp"></i> 支出</span></div><div class="chart-wrapper"><div class="chart-y"><span>10k</span><span>7.5k</span><span>5k</span><span>2.5k</span><span>0</span></div><div class="chart-body"><div class="gridlines"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="bar-groups" id="bars"><div class="bar-group"><div class="pair"><span class="bar in" style="height:60%"></span><span class="bar out" style="height:34%"></span></div><label>6 月</label></div><div class="bar-group"><div class="pair"><span class="bar in" style="height:80%"></span><span class="bar out" style="height:40%"></span></div><label>7 月</label></div><div class="bar-group"><div class="pair"><span class="bar in" style="height:64%"></span><span class="bar out" style="height:46%"></span></div><label>8 月</label></div><div class="bar-group"><div class="pair"><span class="bar in" style="height:90%"></span><span class="bar out" style="height:29%"></span></div><label>9 月</label></div><div class="bar-group"><div class="pair"><span class="bar in" style="height:74%"></span><span class="bar out" style="height:52%"></span></div><label>10 月</label></div><div class="bar-group"><div class="pair"><span class="bar in" style="height:82%"></span><span class="bar out" style="height:23.5%"></span></div><label>11 月</label></div></div></div></div></div></section>
        <section class="panel category-panel" id="category-panel"><div class="panel-top"><div><div class="section-kicker">SPENDING MIX</div><h2>钱花在哪儿了</h2><p>本月支出类别分布</p></div><button class="icon-menu" aria-label="更多信息">···</button></div><div class="donut-layout"><div class="donut" role="img" aria-label="饮食42%、购物32%、交通17%、其他9%"><div class="donut-center"><small>本月总支出</small><strong>¥2,350</strong></div></div><div class="category-legend"><div><i style="background:#2f8f75"></i><span>饮食</span><strong>42%</strong></div><div><i style="background:#a9b8f2"></i><span>购物</span><strong>32%</strong></div><div><i style="background:#f2b482"></i><span>交通</span><strong>17%</strong></div><div><i style="background:#e4e9e4"></i><span>其他</span><strong>9%</strong></div></div></div><div class="category-note">✿ <span>小发现：</span> 饮食占比最高，下次记得给自己安排一顿好吃的！</div></section>
      </div>
      <div class="bottom-grid">
        <section class="panel transaction-panel" id="records"><div class="panel-top"><div><div class="section-kicker">LITTLE MOMENTS</div><h2>最近的收支记录</h2><p>每一笔，都是生活的小片段</p></div><button class="text-link" id="view-all">查看全部 <span>↗</span></button></div><div class="transaction-list">
          <div class="transaction-row"><div class="cat-icon food">☕</div><div class="tx-copy"><strong>周末咖啡</strong><span>饮食 · 11 月 7 日 14:25</span></div><div class="tx-money minus">− ¥28.00</div></div>
          <div class="transaction-row"><div class="cat-icon work">✦</div><div class="tx-copy"><strong>兼职收入</strong><span>工资 · 11 月 6 日 19:10</span></div><div class="tx-money plus">+ ¥800.00</div></div>
          <div class="transaction-row"><div class="cat-icon transit">↗</div><div class="tx-copy"><strong>地铁出行</strong><span>交通 · 11 月 6 日 08:45</span></div><div class="tx-money minus">− ¥6.00</div></div>
          <div class="transaction-row"><div class="cat-icon shopping">✿</div><div class="tx-copy"><strong>新买的小台灯</strong><span>购物 · 11 月 5 日 20:35</span></div><div class="tx-money minus">− ¥89.00</div></div>
        </div></section>
        <section class="quote-panel"><div class="quote-kicker">THIS WEEK'S NOTE <span>↗</span></div><div class="quote-mark">“</div><h3>认真生活的人，<br>连零钱都有光。</h3><div class="quote-line"></div><p>已坚持记录 <strong>7</strong> 天 <span>✳</span></p><img src="assets/potted-plant.svg" alt="小盆栽插画"/></section>
      </div>
      <footer class="footer">拾光账本 <span>✳</span> 把今天妥善收藏 <span>·</span> 仅供界面设计预览，所有数据为虚构示例</footer>
    </div>
  </main>
 </div>
 <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modal" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-title"><button class="close" id="close-modal" aria-label="关闭">×</button><span class="modal-eyebrow">A NEW LITTLE MOMENT ✳</span><h2 id="modal-title">记下今天这一笔</h2><p class="modal-sub">不需要精确到每一分钱，记下生活的节奏就好。</p><div class="type-select"><button class="active" data-type="expense">↗ 记支出</button><button data-type="income">↙ 记收入</button></div><div class="form-group"><label>金额 <span>AMOUNT</span></label><div class="amount-input"><span>¥</span><input type="number" value="28.00" min="0.01" step="0.01" placeholder="0.00"/></div></div><div class="form-cols"><div class="form-group"><label>日期</label><input type="date" value="2026-11-07"/></div><div class="form-group"><label>类别</label><select><option>饮食</option><option>交通</option><option>购物</option><option>工资</option><option>其他</option></select></div></div><div class="form-group"><label>备注</label><input placeholder="写下这笔钱的小故事（选填）"/></div><button class="save-btn" id="save-preview">保存这一刻 <span>↗</span></button><p class="prototype-tip">这是 UI 交互预览，不会写入 JSON 文件；实际功能由组员实现。</p></div></div>
 <div class="toast" id="toast">✳ 这是设计预览。接入 storage.py 后即可保存真实数据。</div>
 <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
